---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="First-Time Homebuyers">
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-8">First-Time Homebuyer Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-center text-gray-600 mb-12">You CAN buy a home—even with limited savings. Here's how.</p>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">You Don't Need 20% Down</h2>
        <p>That's the biggest myth in real estate. Most of my first-time buyers put down 0-3.5%.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-cyan mt-8 mb-4">Your Path to Homeownership</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li><strong>Get Pre-Approved</strong> - Know your buying power before house hunting</li>
          <li><strong>Find Your Program</strong> - FHA, VA, USDA, or Down Payment Assistance</li>
          <li><strong>Work With the Right Agent</strong> - I can refer you to great ones</li>
          <li><strong>Make a Strong Offer</strong> - My pre-approvals carry weight</li>
          <li><strong>Close Fast</strong> - 14-30 days from contract to keys</li>
        </ol>
        
        <div class="bg-primary-cyan/10 p-8 rounded-lg mt-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to Start?</h3>
          <a href="https://calendly.com/dennisfieldsmortgagepro" target="_blank" class="inline-block bg-primary-magenta text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-pink-600">
            Schedule Your Free Consultation
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
